  "tail_review": "PDF409 blank,410 library slip,411 back board,412 cover. Two extra trailing pages add no specimen extraction work.",
  "border_quality_decision": "Side-by-side comparison of the first large border, hatched acanthus and Meridian flower selected the less compressed native Hathi images. No new sampling pixels are claimed. The 153 accepted border components use retained native crops. A separate comparison on PDF199 confirmed that the monochrome Hathi image preserves crisper edges than the compressed JP2; already plugged fine interiors remain unresolved."
